{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>For mine is every firstborn.</b> The meaning is that the firstborn too are mine." "<b>On the day I struck</b> — its sense is temporal, and likewise many others." "<b>Mine they shall be.</b> Its meaning: they are mine and mine they shall be, for every firstborn of man shall be redeemed, and likewise every firstborn of an unclean animal."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:04.105793202Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}